Subgraphs\",\"TransactionSimulationApi\",\"TransactionReceiptsApi\",\"UserOperationsApi\",\"GasManagerApi\",\"Websockets\",\"Webhooks\"],\"websiteUrl\":\"https://arbitrum.io/\",\"alchemyDocsUrl\":\"https://docs.alchemy.com/reference/arbitrum-api-quickstart\",\"githubUrl\":\"https://github.com/OffchainLabs\",\"blockSpeed\":\"\u003c1s\",\"bridgeUrl\":\"https://bridge.arbitrum.io/\",\"name\":\"Arbitrum Sepolia\",\"about\":\"Arbitrum Sepolia is the official testnet for Arbitrum One, providing developers with a safe rollup environment to test apps and cross-chain interactions.\",\"buildOnAlchemy\":\"Alchemy provides Arbitrum Sepolia RPC endpoints, so you can reliably test your code before shipping to mainnet. With a suite of devtools and data APIs, you have everything you need to confidently debug and harden your code.\",\"category\":\"L2\",\"officialDocsUrl\":\"https://docs.arbitrum.io/welcome/get-started\",\"token\":\"ARB\",\"settlement\":\"Ethereum Sepolia\",\"faucetUrl\":\"https://www.alchemy.com/faucets/arbitrum-sepolia\"},{\"id\":\"opbnb-testnet\",\"chainName\":\"opBNB\",\"networkName\":\"Testnet\",\"slug\":\"opbnb-testnet\",\"chainId\":5611,\"gasToken\":\"opBNB\",\"blockExplorer\":\"https://testnet.opbnbscan.com/\",\"isTestnet\":true,\"supportedProducts\":[\"NodeApi\",\"GasManagerApi\",\"EmbeddedAccounts\",\"BundlerApi\",\"Websockets\",\"DebugApi\"],\"websiteUrl\":\"https://bnbchain.org/\",\"alchemyDocsUrl\":\"https://docs.alchemy.com/reference/opbnb-chain-api-quickstart\",\"githubUrl\":\"https://github.com/bnb-chain/opbnb\",\"blockSpeed\":\"1s\",\"bridgeUrl\":\"https://opbnb-bridge.bnbchain.org/deposit\",\"name\":\"opBNB Testnet\",\"about\":\"This network is the primary test environment for opBNB.\",\"buildOnAlchemy\":\"Alchemy offers reliable opBNB testnet RPC endpoints, enriched data APIs, and a suite of devtools so you can confidently test your code before shipping to mainnet.\",\"category\":\"L2\",\"officialDocsUrl\":\"https://docs.bnbchain.org/bnb-opbnb/overview/\"},{\"id\":\"mode-mainnet\",\"chainName\":\"Mode\",\"networkName\":\"Mainnet\",\"slug\":\"mode\",\"chainId\":34443,\"gasToken\":\"ETH\",\"blockExplorer\":\"https://explorer.mode.network/\",\"isTestnet\":false,\"supportedProducts\":[\"NodeApi\",\"Websockets\",\"DebugApi\"],\"websiteUrl\":\"https://mode.com\",\"githubUrl\":\"https://github.com/mode-network\",\"blockSpeed\":\"2s\",\"bridgeUrl\":\"https://bridge.mode.network\",\"name\":\"Mode Mainnet\",\"about\":\"Mode is an OP Stack L2 in the Optimism Superchain, and powered by \\\"DeFAI\\\" with a strong focus emphasis on enabling DeFi and AI agents. With a native perpetuals DEX and an AI Terminal to drive AI agent activity, Mode is building a new onchain economy that rewards contributions to network growth.\",\"buildOnAlchemy\":\"Alchemy offers Mode RPC endpoints and websockets, ensuring that you have reliable, performant, and accurate onchain data. The best UX starts with a stable foundation.\",\"category\":\"L2\",\"officialDocsUrl\":\"https://docs.mode.network/\",\"token\":\"MODE\"},{\"id\":\"settlus-septestnet\",\"chainName\":\"Settlus\",\"networkName\":\"Sepolia\",\"slug\":\"settlus-sepolia\",\"chainId\":5373,\"gasToken\":\"ETH\",\"blockExplorer\":\"https://settlus-sepolia-testnet.explorer.alchemy.com/\",\"isTestnet\":true,\"supportedProducts\":[\"NodeApi\",\"Subgraphs\",\"Webhooks\",\"TokenApi\",\"TransfersApi\",\"NftApi\",\"Websockets\",\"DebugApi\"],\"websiteUrl\":\"https://settlus.org/\",\"alchemyDocsUrl\":\"https://www.alchemy.com/docs/reference/settlus-api-quickstart\",\"githubUrl\":\"https://github.com/settlus\",\"blockSpeed\":\"\u003c1s\",\"bridgeUrl\":\"https://settlus-sep-testnet.bridge.alchemy.com/\",\"name\":\"Settlus Sepolia\",\"about\":\"This is the primary testing environment for Settlus.\",\"buildOnAlchemy\":\"Alchemy provides Settlus Sepolia RPC endpoints, dashboard analytics, rich data APIs, and more. With Alchemy devtools and infra, you can ship faster.\",\"category\":\"ROLLUP\",\"officialDocsUrl\":\"https://docs.settlus.org/\",\"framework\":\"Optimism\",\"dataAvailability\":\"Ethereum\",\"settlement\":\"Ethereum\",\"provider\":\"Alchemy\",\"sequencerEndpoint\":\"settlus-sep-testnet-sequencer.g.alchemy.com/\",\"publicRpcUrl\":\"https://settlus-septestnet.g.alchemy.com/public\",\"publicWssUrl\":\"wss://settlus-septestnet.g.alchemy.com/public\"},{\"id\":\"arb-mainnet\",\"chainName\":\"Arbitrum\",\"networkName\":\"Mainnet\",\"slug\":\"arbitrum\",\"chainId\":42161,\"gasToken\":\"ETH\",\"blockExplorer\":\"https://explorer.arbitrum.io\",\"isTestnet\":false,\"supportedProducts\":[\"BlockTimestampApi\",\"NodeApi\",\"NftApi\",\"TokenApi\",\"TransfersApi\",\"BundlerApi\",\"DebugApi\",\"EmbeddedAccounts\",\"Subgraphs\",\"TransactionSimulationApi\",\"TransactionReceiptsApi\",\"UserOperationsApi\",\"GasManagerApi\",\"Websockets\",\"Webhooks\",\"PricesApi\",\"TraceApi\"],\"websiteUrl\":\"https://arbitrum.io/\",\"alchemyDocsUrl\":\"https://docs.alchemy.com/reference/arbitrum-api-quickstart\",\"githubUrl\":\"https://github.com/OffchainLabs\",\"blockSpeed\":\"\u003c1s\",\"bridgeUrl\":\"https://bridge.arbitrum.io/\",\"name\":\"Arbitrum Mainnet\",\"about\":\"Arbitrum is an optimistic rollup that inherits Ethereum security while delivering sub-cent gas fees and high throughput. Arbitrum's Orbit and Stylus tooling attract builders deploying complex, low-latency apps without leaving the Ethereum ecosystem.\",\"buildOnAlchemy\":\"Alchemy provides enterprise-grade Arbitrum RPC endpoints with low-latency and industry-leading throughput. You can also access tools like transaction tracing, real-time alerts, debugging APIs, and a full-featured dashboard to support your Arbitrum app.\",\"category\":\"L2\",\"officialDocsUrl\":\"https://docs.arbitrum.io/welcome/get-started\",\"token\":\"ARB\",\"settlement\":\"Ethereum\",\"faucetUrl\":\"https://www.alchemy.com/faucets/arbitrum-sepolia\",\"publicRpcUrl\":\"https://arb-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/public\"},{\"id\":\"celestiabridge-mocha\"